>
  <p class="lead-para">
    <strong>BSc Agriculture career options in India fall into three kinds of work: an exam post (bank, state or ICAR), a company job, or a business you own. The routes that grow past a fixed pay scale are the ones where you sell your farm knowledge directly: advice, an input shop, FPO work, your own agri-enterprise, or drone services.</strong>
    Pair the degree with one of these and proof people can check, and it becomes a high-value skill portfolio that supports better income options and earlier financial freedom.
  </p>

  <div class="key-takeaways">
    <p class="key-takeaways__label">The short version</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Answer:</strong> A BSc Agriculture opens twelve routes. The three exam routes (bank, state and ICAR) are Not so scalable. The business routes are Scalable or Scalable with a business layer, and the degree only gets you in.</li>
      <li><strong>Decision filter:</strong> The national exam fills at most about one seat in five, so check how you got your seat, then pick routes by who pays you and the rule you must meet.</li>
      <li><strong>Next step:</strong> Choose two routes, open the notice or licence page for each, and finish one small piece of farm work in each before you pay for an MSc or MBA.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <p>
    Students keep asking "what can I do after BSc Agriculture?", "is MSc compulsory?" and "which government job should I aim for?". Most pages answer with a list of job titles. This guide gives the payer, the entry rule, the sum and a scalability label for each route. Whether farming itself is worth it is a different question, answered in <a href="/blog/career-options/is-agriculture-a-good-career-in-india/">is agriculture a good career in India</a>. The ICAR biotechnology exams are mapped in <a href="/blog/career-options/plant-and-agricultural-biotechnology-careers/">plant and agricultural biotechnology careers</a>. More degree guides sit in <a href="/blog/career-options/">career options</a>. If you want a second opinion on your shortlist, <a href="https://futurecareerschool.com/services/career-counselling-and-career-guidance/career-guidance-after-bsc/">career guidance after BSc</a> looks at your marks, money and home situation together.
  </p>

