        <div class="lane-row lane-row--watch"><span>Watch out</span> {c.watch}</div>
      </div>
    ))}
  </div>

  <div class="callout">
    <p class="callout__eyebrow">Natural farming: a gap with a catch</p>
    <ul class="callout__list">
      <li>The national mission on natural farming was approved on 25 November 2024 with a Rs 2,481 crore outlay, 15,000 clusters and a goal of 1 crore farmers. The plan includes 10,000 input resource centres and a simpler certification with a common brand.</li>
      <li>By 22 July 2025 a report counted 2,045 of the 10,000 centres as set up, which is 20 percent. A gap like that is room for trained people, and also a sign that scheme timelines slip.</li>
      <li>The Rs 4,000 per acre a year incentive goes to farmers, not to you. Build a service that a farmer would pay for even without it.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <h2 id="who-pays">Who pays, and the first sales step</h2>

  <p>
    Every route has a "who pays and how do they trust you" layer. Most BSc Agriculture students are never taught it. Keep it basic: say who you help, show proof, follow up once, and ask for a name of someone else who needs the help.
  </p>

